1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,200
Your ride knows where you were.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,400
How you moved. What almost happened.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,600
Ridary keeps it private.

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,800
Hybrid AI through Firebase AI Logic turns it into proof.

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,400
Most safety apps upload first.

6
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:20,100
Ridary flips it: hybrid AI starts on the phone.

7
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:24,200
Raw GPS and motion stay on the iPhone.

8
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,600
Only a derived summary can leave.

9
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:32,100
Start a ride. Put the phone away.

10
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:36,200
No camera. No audio.

11
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:40,400
GPS and motion are captured locally.

12
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:44,000
The last 30 seconds can be locked on device.

13
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Nothing is uploaded.

14
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,500
The last thirty seconds are locked on this iPhone.

15
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:49,800
Nothing leaves the device.

16
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:54,300
The recap is generated on this iPhone.

17
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:58,300
Apple Foundation Models, on device.

18
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:02,000
The source badge says On device.

19
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,500
Fallback is local rules — never a silent cloud upload.

20
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:10,100
Ask Ridary uses the same boundary.

21
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:14,200
Answers come from a compact local context.

22
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:19,300
Every answer is labeled with its source.

23
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:24,500
The cloud gets a different job.

24
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:29,200
Anonymized events become a community risk map.

25
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:34,000
Riders compare their week, risk cells, and moments.

26
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Patterns, not raw routes.

27
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,400
Collective insight without surveillance.

28
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:48,100
Then a signed safety band.

29
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:52,200
Verify the score, the period, and the signature.

30
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:57,400
Proof — not route, sensors, or identity.

31
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:02,500
Private reasoning at the edge.

32
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:06,400
Collective insight in the cloud.

33
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:11,000
Raw GPS and sensor windows never cross this line.

34
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:15,100
Only a derived summary and a signature do.

35
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:19,400
Firebase App Check protects every call.

36
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:24,400
A voice for riders.

37
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:28,000
A signal for cities.

38
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:32,500
A proof for insurers. No camera. No automatic dispatch.

39
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:36,900
Every ride. On record.

40
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:41,000
Ridary. Private by design. Proof on demand.
